          <div class="yoy-row"><span class="yoy-label">ขายเป็นครั้งคราว</span><span class="yoy-vals"><span class="yoy-old">19.66%</span><span class="yoy-arrow">→</span><span class="yoy-new down">11.27%</span></span></div>
